    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a city where every conversation could be the key to solving a murder or the reason you\u2019re led astray! <strong>Case Closed</strong> is a gripping, first-person detective game that puts you in the role of an investigator navigating a world where every citizen has their own story to tell.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532160/extras/06dd28b0aeb134607ca1b8d0e56ff122.webp?t=1749642733\" /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your journey as a detective in a city filled with AI-driven citizens. Each individual has a unique backstory and motivations that could be crucial to solving the mystery. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532160/extras/4f4784e11ec1bd91c3e600de315ab2a3.poster.avif?t=1749642733\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532160/extras/4f4784e11ec1bd91c3e600de315ab2a3.webm?t=1749642733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532160/extras/4f4784e11ec1bd91c3e600de315ab2a3.mp4?t=1749642733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532160/extras/6c372a802540d98ef1ab8e7fc87ab8b5.webp?t=1749642733\" /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize a unique dialogue system to engage with AI citizens. Click to initiate conversation, type your inquiries, and navigate through dynamic responses that evolve based on your approach and previous interactions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532160/extras/4402a66228398c010affa78ef578ee57.poster.avif?t=1749642733\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532160/extras/4402a66228398c010affa78ef578ee57.webm?t=1749642733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532160/extras/4402a66228398c010affa78ef578ee57.mp4?t=1749642733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532160/extras/ef3d189e5efbeddbbc2e87ac804eac32.webp?t=1749642733\" /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay close attention to the details. The devil is in the dialogue, and each interaction could reveal a crucial piece of the puzzle. Keep meticulous notes on alibis, motives, and relationships to expose inconsistencies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532160/extras/c7fbf2bc06f18cade2c73ddedf81c30f.poster.avif?t=1749642733\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532160/extras/c7fbf2bc06f18cade2c73ddedf81c30f.webm?t=1749642733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532160/extras/c7fbf2bc06f18cade2c73ddedf81c30f.mp4?t=1749642733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532160/extras/a24351d9e87b2411407052aed53a610c.webp?t=1749642733\" /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you believe you\u2019ve identified the murderer, head to the police station to make your accusation. Choose wisely\u2014your reputation and the safety of the city depend on your accuracy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532160/extras/61d5c1407550d089e702939837b809f2.poster.avif?t=1749642733\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532160/extras/61d5c1407550d089e702939837b809f2.webm?t=1749642733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532160/extras/61d5c1407550d089e702939837b809f2.mp4?t=1749642733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532160/extras/89efd9fbd34c3a793e7bafe9ee53a862.webp?t=1749642733\" /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a detective in <strong>Case Closed</strong>, where every case is a new challenge. Can you navigate through the lies and secrets to uncover the truth? Your detective journey begins now. Prove you have what it takes to solve the mystery before it\u2019s too late! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game is in Early Access\u2014join our community on Discord and help shape the future of <i>Case Closed</i>. Your feedback is essential in creating the ultimate detective experience!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a city where every conversation could be the key to solving a murder or the reason you\u2019re led astray! <strong>Case Closed</strong> is a gripping, first-person detective game that puts you in the role of an investigator navigating a world where every citizen has their own story to tell.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532160/extras/06dd28b0aeb134607ca1b8d0e56ff122.webp?t=1749642733\" /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your journey as a detective in a city filled with AI-driven citizens. Each individual has a unique backstory and motivations that could be crucial to solving the mystery. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532160/extras/4f4784e11ec1bd91c3e600de315ab2a3.poster.avif?t=1749642733\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532160/extras/4f4784e11ec1bd91c3e600de315ab2a3.webm?t=1749642733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532160/extras/4f4784e11ec1bd91c3e600de315ab2a3.mp4?t=1749642733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532160/extras/6c372a802540d98ef1ab8e7fc87ab8b5.webp?t=1749642733\" /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize a unique dialogue system to engage with AI citizens. Click to initiate conversation, type your inquiries, and navigate through dynamic responses that evolve based on your approach and previous interactions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline 