4your reputation and the safety of the city depend on your accuracy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532160/extras/61d5c1407550d089e702939837b809f2.poster.avif?t=1749642733\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532160/extras/61d5c1407550d089e702939837b809f2.webm?t=1749642733\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532160/extras/61d5c1407550d089e702939837b809f2.mp4?t=1749642733\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532160/extras/89efd9fbd34c3a793e7bafe9ee53a862.webp?t=1749642733\" /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a detective in <strong>Case Closed</strong>, where every case is a new challenge. Can you navigate through the lies and secrets to uncover the truth? Your detective journey begins now. Prove you have what it takes to solve the mystery before it\u2019s too late! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game is in Early Access\u2014join our community on Discord and help shape the future of <i>Case Closed</i>. Your feedback is essential in creating the ultimate detective experience!</strong></p>",
