    "legal_notice": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCLAIMER</h2><br><strong>Use of Local AI-Driven NPCs in Case Closed</strong><br>In Case Closed, developed by Otso Tech, we utilize a local Large Language Model (LLM) integrated directly into the game to provide dynamic, AI-driven NPC interactions. All inputs you provide during gameplay are processed locally on your device.<br><br><strong>Data Handling and Privacy:</strong><br>No Personal Data Collection: Otso Tech does not collect, store, or process any personal data. All gameplay inputs and NPC responses are handled locally on your machine.<br><br><strong>Third-Party Software Notices:</strong><br>The AI-driven functionality in Case Closed uses third-party software libraries under the following licenses:<br>\t\u2022\tllama.cpp (MIT License)<br>\t\u2022\tllamafile (Apache 2.0 License)<br><br>For more details on the licenses, please refer to the respective project pages.<br><br><strong>Player Advisory:</strong><br>We advise players not to input sensitive, personal, or financial information during gameplay. The game is designed for entertainment purposes only.<br><br>By playing Case Closed, you acknowledge and agree to the local processing of your inputs as described.<br><br>Thank you for playing Case Closed.",
